{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of pet reptile names","evidence":"[D2:20 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: I want to show you one of my snakes! They always calm me down and make me happy. This is Susie.\n[D2:22 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene:  I was playing video games and my pet just slinked out of her cage and coiled up next to me - it was too funny! My second snake Seraphim did it. Look at her sly eyes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:840a5603-c1f8-53b7-a7ae-b1722d79f6ca","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0329dc58f23c0c5d727989c44ff569052e1f7652d533ff4f8eaecb2c7e8bed67","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of Jolene's snakes?","referenceAnswer":"Susie, Seraphim","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0329dc58f23c0c5d727989c44ff569052e1f7652d533ff4f8eaecb2c7e8bed67"}}]}